@startuml
title Flujo de notificaciones internas V3

actor Asesor
actor Supervisor
actor Administrador
participant "Promesa/CNA Service" as Service
participant "WorkflowNotifier" as Notifier
participant "WorkflowMailer" as Mailer
participant "Laravel Notification" as Notification
database "notifications" as Notifications
participant "Topbar campanita" as Bell
actor "Usuario receptor" as Receiver

== Asesor crea solicitud ==
Asesor -> Service: Crear Promesa/CNA
Service -> Notifier: pendiente()
Notifier -> Mailer: Enviar correo accion requerida
Notifier -> Notification: WorkflowActionRequiredNotification
Notification -> Notifications: Guardar para supervisor
Supervisor -> Bell: Abre campanita
Bell -> Notifications: GET /notificaciones
Bell -> Supervisor: Abrir autorizacion

== Supervisor crea o preaprueba ==
Supervisor -> Service: Crear/preaprobar
Service -> Notifier: preaprobada()
Notifier -> Mailer: Enviar correo accion requerida
Notifier -> Notification: WorkflowActionRequiredNotification
Notification -> Notifications: Guardar para administradores
Administrador -> Bell: Abre campanita
Bell -> Administrador: Abrir autorizacion

== Administrador crea o resuelve ==
Administrador -> Service: Crear/aprobar/rechazar
Service -> Notifier: resuelta()
Notifier -> Mailer: Enviar correo informativo
Notifier -> Notification: WorkflowStatusNotification
Notification -> Notifications: Guardar estado informativo
Receiver -> Bell: Ver estado
Bell -> Receiver: /clientes/{dni}

@enduml
